    <string name="cloud_consent_title">Allow automatic cloud uploads?</string>
    <string name="cloud_consent_body">%1$s will receive recordings, filenames, language and model settings from your selected folder to create transcripts. Existing recordings without a transcript and new recordings will upload automatically, including in the background. Provider charges, retention and data-use terms apply to your API account. Only upload audio you have permission to share. Choose Local Smart in Settings or remove an API key to stop queued cloud jobs and withdraw upload permission. Already sent audio must be managed with the provider.</string>
